6. Policy configuration layer

Policy file (YAML/JSON):

profiles:
  PRODUCTION_SAFE:
    rules:
      - match:
          severity: [HARD, FATAL]
          scope: [ARRAY, SYSTEM]
        decision: ABORT_TICK
        actions: []
      - match:
          severity: [SOFT, WARN]
          scope: [FIELD, SEGMENT]
        decision: COMMIT_WITH_FIXES
        actions:
          - type: REPAIR_PATCH
          - type: DEGRADE_MODE
            params: { target_mode: SAFE }

Loaded at startup; optionally hot‑reloadable.

Arbitrator uses this to generate ResolutionPlan.

